cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Civ6-AlphaZero"
abstract: >-
  An AlphaZero/MuZero-style self-play reinforcement-learning system for a
  simplified Civilization-like environment (MicroCiv), with a seeded,
  CPU-reproducible training stack, a measured evaluation methodology and a
  demo-grade bridge into Civilization VI.
authors:
